      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's possible that the specific behavior you're exhibiting in these groups isn't aligning with their norms or culture, leading to misunderstandings or rule breaches resulting in muting. It might be beneficial to review each group's rules and try to adjust your engagement to better fit their expectations. If you're concerned about algorithmic flags, try to interact using age-appropriate, respectful language and content. On Discord, there isn't an explicit \"off\" user detection system, but the moderation team handles reports based on their guidelines, so feedback or reports from members might be worthwhile.",
